              "value": "Jury-Rig"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(manipulate)\n\nThe capstan swabbie uses built-in tools to quickly patch itself up. The swabbie gains 10 temporary Hit Points. The swabbie can also use this section on an adjacent section of a ship. The temporary Hit Points last for 1 minute. The target is then temporarily immune for 1 hour."
